 	SETTING("experimental.rsx_idle_park", "Experimental", "FPS Experiments", "RSX idle park", "When the RSX command queue has stayed empty for one millisecond, the RSX thread sleeps in 50-microsecond steps instead of spinning, which frees a CPU core for the SPU and PPU threads. A memory flush, flip or ZCULL request from another thread wakes it at once; new guest commands are seen within one step. Applies with RSX FIFO Idle Wait set to Yield. Automatic enables it for every title; Disabled spins as before. Takes effect on the next boot.", kind::RPCS3_IOS_SETTING_CHOICE, g_cfg.ios_experimental.rsx_idle_park, 0, 0, 0),
