 	GAME_SETTING("experimental.ppu_grace", "Experimental", "FPS Experiments", "PPU grace after starvation", "When a PPU or SPU thread finally resumes guest memory access after starving behind SPU reservation write locks, new write locks wait about 100 us more before stopping the PPU threads again, so the thread runs before the next one. Every write lock is still taken and parks every PPU thread; it is only taken later, within the same bound. Automatic enables it for every title, with Passive lock fairness. Takes effect on the next boot.", kind::RPCS3_IOS_SETTING_CHOICE, g_cfg.ios_experimental.ppu_grace, 0, 0, 0),
